<title>USA: Outdoor Systems sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Outdoor Systems sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Outdoor Systems Inc said its board of directors authorized a 3-for-2 stock split in the form of a stock dividend, payable on November 22, to shareholders of record November 11.</p>
</text>
